          "text": "The undersigned, being the __________________ of the Borrower and being authorized to issue this certificate, hereby certifies pursuant to Section 6.1(d) of the Credit Agreement that such Responsible Officer of the Borrower is familiar with the Credit Agreement and that, in accordance with each of the following sections of the Credit Agreement, each of the following is true on the date hereof: (A) In accordance with"
