          "limit": 2.75,
          "unit": "x",
          "direction": "max",
          "maintenance": false,
          "text": "g) does not exceed 50% of the Eligible Library Value, and (z) at the time of, or after giving effect to such Incremental Term Borrowing (and any Investments made with such funds), the Borrower is in pro forma compliance with the financial covenants set forth in Article V (including that the Maximum Consolidated Leverage Ratio does not exceed 2.75:1.00 in any event);"
        },
