          "maintenance": false,
          "text": "h quarterly financial statements are available (i) Consolidated Adjusted EBITDA, pro forma for the Acquisition, that is not less than $12.5 million, (ii) a ratio of (A) Consolidated Total Debt to (B) Consolidated Adjusted EBITDA of no more than 3.65:1.00 and (iii) projections showing a Consolidated Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio for the next full fiscal quarter of no less than 1.15:1.00."
        }
